    "novelty": "The proposal introduces a novel sparse, milestone-based integration of facet-based novelty checking within chain-of-ideas frameworks, shifting away from dense inline retrieval loops or naive negative prompt injection.",
    "feasibility": "The methodology relies on standard API access, open-weight local models, and compressed vector storage, which fit well within the stated 6-week timeframe and consumer GPU/API constraints.",
    "clarity": "The operational pipeline, stopping states, secondary validation passes, and experimental comparisons are clearly defined and structured.",
    "importance": "Addressing API latency, prompt context degradation, and novelty drift in automated scientific ideation is highly valuable for scalable autonomous discovery.",
    "evidence_grounding": "All central literature claims regarding the limitations of novelty evaluation, retrieval-augmented novelty checkers, and baseline inspiration frameworks are traceably supported by the provided literature."
  },
