      "claim": "Automated scientific idea generation systems have made remarkable progress, yet the automatic evaluation of idea novelty remains a critical and underexplored challenge.",
      "relation": "supports"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "s_230075a885f80bac91eb",
      "claim": "The Idea Novelty Checker provides an LLM-based retrieval-augmented generation framework utilizing a two-stage retrieve-then-rerank approach.",
      "relation": "supports"
    },
    {
