      "claim": "The Idea Novelty Checker collects relevant papers via snippet retrieval and refines them using embedding filtering and facet-based re-ranking.",
      "relation": "supports"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "s_7c82e4ee535140d0eb6c",
      "claim": "SciMON uses retrieval of inspirations from past papers and iteratively updates idea suggestions until novelty is achieved.",
